{#
  Notes index — the listing shared by /notes and the topic pages under it
  (/notes/{topic}): whisper, title, an optional standfirst; the page's notes as
  cards; the topics as a pill row; the pagination. One template, so the two
  can't drift.

    query      — the notes query, already filtered and ordered, with its limit
                 set (the caller paginates through this include)
    whisper    — the eyebrow
    title      — the h1
    standfirst — HTML for the standfirst, or null
    topic      — the current topic category on a topic page, else null
    allCurrent — whether "All notes" is the current view (true on /notes;
                 false on a listing that's neither the index nor a topic,
                 like a year)
#}
{% paginate query as pageInfo, notes %}

{# The list, the topics and the pagination go through the content component as
   one block, like About's case content, so they sit inside the timeline: the
   trailing spine and end node come after them rather than hanging below. #}
{# On a topic page every card would carry the same chip, so the list drops it. #}
{# The topics sit between the list and the pagination in the flow, and on wide
   screens float themselves out into the right-hand gutter as a boxed panel (the
   Summary panel's placement, mirrored — see .c-topics). asideInset gives the
   blocks the gutter layout that makes room for it. #}
{% set blocks = include('_components/notes-list', { notes: notes, showTopic: not (topic ?? null) }, with_context = false)
    ~ include('_components/topics', { current: topic ?? null, allCurrent: allCurrent ?? true }, with_context = false)
    ~ include('_components/pagination', { pageInfo: pageInfo }, with_context = false) %}

{% include '_components/content' with {
    whisper: whisper,
    title: title,
    body: standfirst ?? null,
    blocks: blocks|trim ? blocks : null,
    blocksAfterBody: true,
    asideInset: true,
} only %}
